&lt;li&gt;Analyze our processes and instigate changes to help scale our operations and improve user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with other Stripe teams to improve our product offerings and messaging around new products and features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain unique insights into how thousands of businesses on Stripe scale and operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an opportunity to learn how Stripe operates from the ground up and make a real impact on the future of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
